<title>INDIA: India Tata Power 96/97 1st half net down.</title>
<headline>India Tata Power 96/97 1st half net down.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p>	     (in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	     858.6  vs   1,202.5</p>
<p>    Sales		  6,907.4  vs   6,806.8</p>
<p>    Expenditure	   4,325.1 vs   4,166.5</p>
<p>    Interest costs	  304.8 vs     451.8</p>
<p>Note: Tata Power Ltd said the results were unaudited. All figures were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom (91-22-265 9000)</p>
</text>
